2. section slicing (match, unique/ambiguous/none, cap per D3).
3. builtin row + handler (exclusivity, kind dispatch, plain-entry
   lines reuse).
4. tests below; rebuild per rules.
5. close-out: spec checkbox (wave-5 item), plans/README status,
